      "lines": [
        "问题"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "步行者、汽车和飞机的匀速运动彼此之间的区别是",
        "什么？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "2",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "匀速运动的速度表示的是什么？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "3",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "已知物体所通过的路程和运动的时间，怎样求运动",
        "的速度？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "4",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "怎样以千米/小时、米/秒为单位来表示给定的速度？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "5",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "物体的速度除了数值以外，还需用什么来表征？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "练习 6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "浮在河中的木筏在 20 分钟内通过了 900 米的路程. 试求木",
        "筏的速度，用米/秒表示."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "2",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "匀速前进的骑车人在 30 分钟内通过了 9 千米的路程. 试求",
        "骑车人的速度，用米/秒表示."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "3",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "ВЛ-23 型电气机车的速度是 90 千米/小时，试以米/秒为单位",
        "表示这个速度."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "18. 变速运动的平均速度"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "物体做变速运动时，在相等的时间间隔内通过的路程不",
        "等. 这种运动的速度是变化的."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "尽管人们知道，火车或汽车停止时的速度为零，开动后速",
        "度逐渐增加，而在接近下一次停车时速度又逐渐减小，但还是",
        "经常说火车具有一个什么样的速度、汽车的速度等. 那么当",
        "说到火车的速度是 60 千米/小时的时候，到底应把这个速度",
        "理解为什么速度呢？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "当谈到变速运动的速度时，所指的是在运动的某一段给"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "40"
      ]
    }
  ]
